  "contentHtml": "<p>&#39;질문하는 십대를 위한 과학탐구&#39;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff24ef834867c4ae5a7d0b3308482bdf518d1376\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"262\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff24ef834867c4ae5a7d0b3308482bdf518d1376\" data-origin-width=\"839\" data-origin-height=\"439\"></div><p>p. 288</p><p>4장 1) 칭찬은 식물의 성장에 얼마나 영향을 줄까?&#160;</p><p>적용후기입니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc6690ee8a154184aade2f51a9e56973f6e75732\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc6690ee8a154184aade2f51a9e56973f6e75732\" data-origin-width=\"368\" data-origin-height=\"451\"></div><p>책에 소개된 내용은</p><p>칭찬의 횟수를 달리하여 보리싹의 성장 정도를 비교하는 탐구인데,</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56cf07e8686cfb6c387523cf0185ecbf75624a40\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56cf07e8686cfb6c387523cf0185ecbf75624a40\" data-origin-width=\"691\" data-origin-height=\"359\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>일단</p><p>학생들이 생명을 탐구하는 흥미를 높이기 위해&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 복도에 다음과 같이 간단한 실험 장치를 설치하였습니다.</p><p>2. 미운 말 목소리가 복도에 쩌렁 울려서 &#39;속삭이며&#39; 를 추가했습니다~</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 40.8416%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a475ba3504a34ae6dc25481f2a46fcd82501e44\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"294\" height=\"522\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a475ba3504a34ae6dc25481f2a46fcd82501e44\" data-origin-width=\"901\" data-origin-height=\"1600\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 59.1584%; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/364aa3b7964cb4f0f3b80fd22513c096ab5aa863\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/364aa3b7964cb4f0f3b80fd22513c096ab5aa863\" data-origin-width=\"364\" data-origin-height=\"499\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>3. 복도를 지나다니는 학생 2명이 찾아와서 무슨 실험인지 궁금해함.</p><p>4. 실험을 설명하고, 탐구해보라고 팀장으로 임명함.</p><p>5. 매일와서 물을 주고 관찰하고 사진을 찍음</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ad4d0a826ee6075db55a27d23aea41c97de1050\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ad4d0a826ee6075db55a27d23aea41c97de1050\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div><p>6. 팀장들은 전교생에게 어떻게 홍보할지를 고민하고 실천함~</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b2ef18565fb3c42f3d5548d013e61714d6a07848\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b2ef18565fb3c42f3d5548d013e61714d6a07848\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92e24f4e3988af32fd93ba07071dd219dafafd8f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92e24f4e3988af32fd93ba07071dd219dafafd8f\" data-origin-width=\"410\" data-origin-height=\"242\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>7. 돌발상황 : 복도에 설치해놓으니 학생들이 지나가다가 실험장치를 건드리는 상황 발생</p><p>&#160; 팀장들이 대책 마련~</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59418a97a0708accf50de5209a95cd41c4830683\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59418a97a0708accf50de5209a95cd41c4830683\" data-origin-width=\"329\" data-origin-height=\"397\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f8a910b7931e2eef11c97c777ad79990e82e3cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f8a910b7931e2eef11c97c777ad79990e82e3cb\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>8. 탐구결과가 기대됩니다~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
